{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/tmp/seldon-coaching-brief","sessionId":"4de7985f-cb4a-49aa-b443-92f19e6e9c9d","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"/seldon Thimbleyard is for the repair café I help run on Saturday mornings in the church hall. Right now the volunteer rota is a paper sheet pinned up in the hall plus a group chat, so people swap shifts in the chat, the sheet never gets updated, and twice this year nobody with a key came and the visitors waited outside. I'm thinking a small web app with the rota on it, but I haven't worked out who gets to see it, what the first version actually covers, or whether it should handle the money side. It will hold about thirty volunteers' phone numbers, and the council grant that pays for the hall depends on the attendance records we send every month, so getting those wrong could cost us the hall."},"uuid":"2049b68d-6bdb-4e3f-8a09-7b8672e1a916","timestamp":"2026-11-17T09:00:00.000Z"}
{"parentUuid":"2049b68d-6bdb-4e3f-8a09-7b8672e1a916","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/tmp/seldon-coaching-brief","sessionId":"4de7985f-cb4a-49aa-b443-92f19e6e9c9d","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_01coachingbrief0002","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-opus-5-5","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Thimbleyard has a real problem behind it, but a lot of it is still open.\n\nRecommended path: coaching\n\nYou haven't settled who sees the rota or what the first version covers, and the stakes are real: thirty volunteers' phone numbers, and attendance records the hall's grant depends on. Those are worth deciding on purpose rather than having me guess.\n\nDoes coaching suit you, or would you rather I take the fast path and draft it with my guesses tagged?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}},"uuid":"8ff41fd8-29f2-47a9-95f4-0674267a46f3","timestamp":"2026-11-17T09:00:05.000Z"}
{"parentUuid":"8ff41fd8-29f2-47a9-95f4-0674267a46f3","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/tmp/seldon-coaching-brief","sessionId":"4de7985f-cb4a-49aa-b443-92f19e6e9c9d","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Coaching, let's do it."},"uuid":"d99c6c76-9890-449f-9d8f-2a860bbcecda","timestamp":"2026-11-17T09:00:10.000Z"}
{"parentUuid":"d99c6c76-9890-449f-9d8f-2a860bbcecda","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/tmp/seldon-coaching-brief","sessionId":"4de7985f-cb4a-49aa-b443-92f19e6e9c9d","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_01coachingbrief0004","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-opus-5-5","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Coaching it is, for Thimbleyard.\n\nThe first decision is who it serves. Who uses Thimbleyard: only the volunteers, or the visitors who bring broken things in too?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}},"uuid":"ea0ee05b-053d-4351-8e30-8fd06822fa48","timestamp":"2026-11-17T09:00:15.000Z"}
{"parentUuid":"ea0ee05b-053d-4351-8e30-8fd06822fa48","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/tmp/seldon-coaching-brief","sessionId":"4de7985f-cb4a-49aa-b443-92f19e6e9c9d","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Only the thirty volunteers and the two coordinators, visitors never log in."},"uuid":"0eaf107b-35bc-43ea-aa0d-14820b8af2d0","timestamp":"2026-11-17T09:00:20.000Z"}
{"parentUuid":"0eaf107b-35bc-43ea-aa0d-14820b8af2d0","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/tmp/seldon-coaching-brief","sessionId":"4de7985f-cb4a-49aa-b443-92f19e6e9c9d","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_01coachingbrief0006","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-opus-5-5","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That settles who it serves. Next is scope. What does the first version cover: the rota, shift swaps, the monthly attendance record for the council, or anything beyond those?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}},"uuid":"2779da05-cfc1-4a88-bad9-17668e6d3d8f","timestamp":"2026-11-17T09:00:25.000Z"}
{"parentUuid":"2779da05-cfc1-4a88-bad9-17668e6d3d8f","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/tmp/seldon-coaching-brief","sessionId":"4de7985f-cb4a-49aa-b443-92f19e6e9c9d","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"The rota, swapping a shift with another volunteer, and the monthly attendance export for the grant, nothing else."},"uuid":"4c1fe169-693e-4361-bb48-946d3de25e6d","timestamp":"2026-11-17T09:00:30.000Z"}
{"parentUuid":"4c1fe169-693e-4361-bb48-946d3de25e6d","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/tmp/seldon-coaching-brief","sessionId":"4de7985f-cb4a-49aa-b443-92f19e6e9c9d","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_01coachingbrief0008","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-opus-5-5","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Next, what Thimbleyard won't do. You mentioned the money side. What will it refuse to do, and why?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}},"uuid":"024728db-bf26-43b6-a40e-5ef6c8002ea7","timestamp":"2026-11-17T09:00:35.000Z"}
{"parentUuid":"024728db-bf26-43b6-a40e-5ef6c8002ea7","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/tmp/seldon-coaching-brief","sessionId":"4de7985f-cb4a-49aa-b443-92f19e6e9c9d","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"It won't take payments or donations, because the treasurer keeps the cash tin and wants every penny counted by hand."},"uuid":"7850c19a-44ed-46ea-9a5a-c8dfd1356569","timestamp":"2026-11-17T09:00:40.000Z"}
{"parentUuid":"7850c19a-44ed-46ea-9a5a-c8dfd1356569","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/tmp/seldon-coaching-brief","sessionId":"4de7985f-cb4a-49aa-b443-92f19e6e9c9d","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_01coachingbrief0010","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-opus-5-5","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Got it. What makes Thimbleyard different from a shared spreadsheet or an off-the-shelf rota app?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}},"uuid":"dd7e608d-ca3a-41bd-9724-5e757351c69a","timestamp":"2026-11-17T09:00:45.000Z"}
{"parentUuid":"dd7e608d-ca3a-41bd-9724-5e757351c69a","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/tmp/seldon-coaching-brief","sessionId":"4de7985f-cb4a-49aa-b443-92f19e6e9c9d","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Two volunteers swap a shift between themselves and the rota updates, so nobody has to chase a coordinator."},"uuid":"2e1a1b1f-fe70-4ef1-b2ba-7073f0d1365e","timestamp":"2026-11-17T09:00:50.000Z"}
{"parentUuid":"2e1a1b1f-fe70-4ef1-b2ba-7073f0d1365e","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/tmp/seldon-coaching-brief","sessionId":"4de7985f-cb4a-49aa-b443-92f19e6e9c9d","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_01coachingbrief0012","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-opus-5-5","content":[{"type":"text","text":"How will you know it's working? What does success look like after a few months?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}},"uuid":"11602d42-e4dd-4ecb-b69c-b4c8bae4a300","timestamp":"2026-11-17T09:00:55.000Z"}
{"parentUuid":"11602d42-e4dd-4ecb-b69c-b4c8bae4a300","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/tmp/seldon-coaching-brief","sessionId":"4de7985f-cb4a-49aa-b443-92f19e6e9c9d","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Success means nobody turns up to a locked hall again."},"uuid":"9bea5e63-fcdb-490d-a1aa-dd10c42d617a","timestamp":"2026-11-17T09:01:00.000Z"}
{"parentUuid":"9bea5e63-fcdb-490d-a1aa-dd10c42d617a","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/tmp/seldon-coaching-brief","sessionId":"4de7985f-cb4a-49aa-b443-92f19e6e9c9d","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_01coachingbrief0014","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-opus-5-5","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Last one: if the first version works, where does Thimbleyard go after that?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0}},"uuid":"775b06d2-1236-4327-9475-088d954b2a77","timestamp":"2026-11-17T09:01:05.000Z"}
